### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/health

### Acquisition status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/acquisition/status

### Register vehicle
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "OMIP-SIM-001",
  "vehicle_name": "Primary simulation vehicle",
  "vehicle_type": "SIMULATED",
  "manufacturer": "OMIP",
  "model": "v0.3.1 simulator",
  "description": "Four-sensor test vehicle"
}

### Register GNSS sensor
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/vehicles/OMIP-SIM-001/sensors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sensor_id": "OMIP-SIM-001-GNSS-001",
  "sensor_name": "Primary GNSS",
  "sensor_type": "GNSS",
  "unit": "m",
  "sampling_rate_hz": 5,
  "coordinate_frame": "LOCAL_ENU"
}

### Create mission
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mission_id": "MISSION-DEMO-001",
  "vehicle_id": "OMIP-SIM-001",
  "name": "v0.3.1 acquisition demonstration",
  "scenario_name": "multi_sensor_nominal",
  "description": "Heartbeat and raw-sensor demonstration"
}

### Start mission
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-DEMO-001/start

### Submit vehicle heartbeat
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/vehicles/OMIP-SIM-001/heartbeat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schema_version": "0.3.1",
  "message_id": "d7335aba-87b8-465d-a45f-99d00ca9760a",
  "vehicle_id": "OMIP-SIM-001",
  "mission_id": "MISSION-DEMO-001",
  "timestamp_utc": "2026-07-18T07:10:10.000+00:00",
  "state": "RUNNING",
  "source": "manual-api-example",
  "metadata": {
    "pending_messages": 0
  }
}

### Heartbeat history
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/vehicles/OMIP-SIM-001/heartbeats?limit=100

### Submit GNSS raw message
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/raw-messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schema_version": "0.3.1",
  "message_id": "4c80fd31-f6dc-44ab-98af-1f5ddce92589",
  "vehicle_id": "OMIP-SIM-001",
  "sensor_id": "OMIP-SIM-001-GNSS-001",
  "mission_id": "MISSION-DEMO-001",
  "sequence_no": 0,
  "timestamp_utc": "2026-07-18T07:10:12.420+00:00",
  "message_type": "GNSS",
  "payload": {
    "coordinate_frame": "LOCAL_ENU",
    "x_m": 1.0,
    "y_m": 2.0,
    "z_m": 0.0,
    "vx_mps": 1.2,
    "vy_mps": 0.3,
    "vz_mps": 0.0
  },
  "quality": {
    "valid": true,
    "position_source": "SIMULATED",
    "confidence": 0.98
  }
}

### Inspect vehicle status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/vehicles/OMIP-SIM-001

### List raw messages for mission
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/raw-messages?mission_id=MISSION-DEMO-001&limit=100

### Sensor quality
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/sensors/OMIP-SIM-001-GNSS-001/quality?mission_id=MISSION-DEMO-001

### Add mission event
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-DEMO-001/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "OMIP-SIM-001",
  "event_type": "GNSS_DROPOUT",
  "start_timestamp_utc": "2026-07-18T07:10:20.000+00:00",
  "end_timestamp_utc": "2026-07-18T07:10:28.000+00:00",
  "severity": "WARNING",
  "source": "MANUAL",
  "description": "GNSS unavailable for eight seconds."
}

### Complete mission — vehicle changes to INACTIVE
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-DEMO-001/complete

### Telemetry CSV export
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-DEMO-001/export?format=csv

### Raw JSONL export
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-DEMO-001/raw/export?format=jsonl

### v0.3.2 - MQTT runtime status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/acquisition/status

### v0.3.2 - Enable or reconfigure MQTT
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/acquisition/mqtt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": true,
  "host": "127.0.0.1",
  "port": 1883
}

### v0.3.2 - Disable MQTT
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/acquisition/mqtt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enabled": false
}


### v0.3.3 - Complete mission export package
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-DEMO-001/export/package

### v0.3.4 - Mission preview used by Dashboard
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-ID/telemetry?limit=20000

### v0.3.4 - Mission raw-message preview used by Dashboard
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/raw-messages?mission_id=MISSION-ID&limit=200


### v0.4.0 - List integrity events for a Mission
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/integrity-events?mission_id=INTEGRITY-DEMO-001&limit=100

### v0.4.0 - List open alerts
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/alerts?status=OPEN&limit=100

### v0.4.0 - Mission integrity summary
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/INTEGRITY-DEMO-001/integrity-summary

### v0.4.0 - Acknowledge an alert
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/alerts/ALERT-ID/acknowledge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor": "operator-name",
  "note": "Investigating the data interruption."
}

### v0.4.0 - Resolve an alert
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/alerts/ALERT-ID/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor": "operator-name",
  "note": "Fault reviewed and closed."
}

### v0.4.1 - Sensor integrity metrics for one Mission
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/sensors/OMIP-SIM-001-GNSS/integrity-metrics?mission_id=MISSION-DEMO-001

### v0.4.1 - Mission integrity metrics
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-DEMO-001/integrity-metrics

### v0.4.1 - Timing Integrity Events
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/integrity-events?mission_id=MISSION-DEMO-001&check_type=HIGH_LATENCY

### v0.4.1 - Automatically resolved alerts
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/alerts?mission_id=MISSION-DEMO-001&status=RESOLVED

### v0.4.2 - Overall system health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/health

### v0.4.2 - Runtime counters and rates
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/metrics

### v0.4.2 - SQLite health and row counts
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/database

### v0.4.2 - Latest application logs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/logs?limit=100

### v0.4.2 - MQTT warning/error logs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/logs?component=MQTT&level=WARNING&limit=100

### v0.4.2 - Historical system metric snapshots
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/metrics/snapshots?limit=200

### v0.4.2 - Open platform alerts
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/platform-alerts?status=OPEN

### v0.4.2 - Acknowledge a platform alert
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/platform-alerts/PLATFORM-ALERT-ID/acknowledge
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor": "operator",
  "note": "Investigating the platform condition."
}

### v0.4.2 - Resolve a platform alert
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/system/platform-alerts/PLATFORM-ALERT-ID/resolve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actor": "operator",
  "note": "The platform component has recovered."
}


### v0.4.3 - Storage summary
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/storage/summary

### v0.4.3 - Paginated Mission telemetry
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-001/telemetry/page?page=1&page_size=500&sort_order=asc

### v0.4.3 - Retention policy
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/storage/retention-policy

### v0.4.3 - Update retention policy
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/storage/retention-policy
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "raw_messages_days": 45,
  "telemetry_days": 365
}

### v0.4.3 - Cleanup preview (read-only)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/storage/cleanup/preview

### v0.4.3 - Create background export job
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/export-jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mission_id": "MISSION-001",
  "export_format": "package"
}

### v0.4.3 - List export jobs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/export-jobs?limit=50

### v0.4.3 - Mission delete preview
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-001/delete-preview

### v0.4.3 - Create SQLite backup
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/storage/backups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "label": "before-cleanup"
}

### v0.4.3 - SQLite integrity check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/storage/integrity-check

### v0.4.3 - WAL checkpoint
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/storage/maintenance/checkpoint

### v0.5.0 - Vehicle type catalogue
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/vehicle-types

### v0.5.0 - Built-in AUV profiles
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/vehicle-profiles?vehicle_type=AUV&enabled_only=true

### v0.5.0 - Create a Simulation Run without launching a process
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/simulation-runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "OMIP-AUV-001",
  "vehicle_type": "AUV",
  "vehicle_profile_id": "auv-research-thruster-v1",
  "scenario_id": "multi_sensor_nominal",
  "duration_s": 120,
  "transport": "http",
  "random_seed": 42,
  "parameter_overrides": {
    "kinematics": {
      "maximum_speed_mps": 1.8
    }
  },
  "launch_process": false
}

### v0.5.0 - Start a real local simulator worker
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/simulation-runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "OMIP-UAV-001",
  "vehicle_type": "UAV",
  "vehicle_profile_id": "uav-quadrotor-research-v1",
  "scenario_id": "multi_sensor_nominal",
  "duration_s": 60,
  "transport": "http",
  "random_seed": 42,
  "parameter_overrides": {},
  "launch_process": true
}

### v0.5.0 - List Simulation Runs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/simulation-runs

### v0.5.0 - Stop a Simulation Run
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/simulation-runs/REPLACE-RUN-ID/stop
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Stopped during operator test"
}

### v0.5.1 - List Scenario templates
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/scenarios

### v0.5.1 - Get the AUV environment example
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/scenarios/auv_current_depth

### v0.5.1 - Create a Scenario
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/scenarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scenario_id": "environment-api-demo",
  "name": "Environment API demo",
  "description": "Scenario created through the v0.5.1 API.",
  "coordinate_frame": "LOCAL_ENU",
  "default_duration_s": 60,
  "sensor_rates_hz": {
    "GNSS": 5,
    "IMU": 20,
    "BATTERY": 1,
    "VEHICLE_STATUS": 2
  },
  "motion": {
    "forward_speed_mps": 1.5
  },
  "obstacles": [],
  "constraints": [],
  "external_fields": []
}

### v0.5.1 - Add an AUV obstacle
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/scenarios/environment-api-demo/obstacles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Subsea structure",
  "obstacle_type": "UNDERWATER_STRUCTURE",
  "geometry": {
    "geometry_type": "SPHERE",
    "position": {"x_m": 25, "y_m": 3, "z_m": -18},
    "radius_m": 3
  },
  "applies_to_vehicle_types": ["AUV"]
}

### v0.5.1 - Add a maximum-depth constraint
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/scenarios/environment-api-demo/constraints
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maximum mission depth",
  "constraint_type": "MAXIMUM_DEPTH",
  "value": 35,
  "unit": "m",
  "severity": "MANDATORY",
  "applies_to_vehicle_types": ["AUV"],
  "required_capabilities": ["supports_depth_control"]
}

### v0.5.1 - Add an ocean current
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/scenarios/environment-api-demo/external-fields
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cross current",
  "field_type": "OCEAN_CURRENT",
  "coordinate_frame": "LOCAL_ENU",
  "vector": {"x": 0.15, "y": 0.25, "z": 0, "unit": "m/s"},
  "unit": "m/s",
  "applies_to_vehicle_types": ["AUV", "USV"]
}

### v0.5.1 - Start a run that stores an environment snapshot
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/simulation-runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "OMIP-AUV-ENV-001",
  "vehicle_type": "AUV",
  "vehicle_profile_id": "auv-research-thruster-v1",
  "scenario_id": "auv_current_depth",
  "duration_s": 120,
  "transport": "http",
  "random_seed": 42,
  "parameter_overrides": {},
  "launch_process": true
}

### v0.5.1 - Read a Mission Environment Snapshot
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-ID/environment

### v0.5.2 - Start UGV obstacle-avoidance simulation
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/simulation-runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicle_id": "OMIP-UGV-052",
  "vehicle_type": "GROUND_VEHICLE",
  "vehicle_profile_id": "ugv-small-ackermann-v1",
  "scenario_id": "ugv_active_avoidance",
  "duration_s": 45,
  "transport": "http",
  "random_seed": 42,
  "parameter_overrides": {},
  "launch_process": true
}

### v0.5.2 - Read Mission obstacle interactions
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-ID/obstacle-interactions?limit=500

### v0.5.2 - Filter warning interactions
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-ID/obstacle-interactions?risk_level=WARNING&limit=500

### v0.5.2 - Mission obstacle summary
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/missions/MISSION-ID/obstacle-summary

### v0.5.2 - Latest vehicle obstacle status
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/vehicles/OMIP-UGV-052/obstacle-status
